# Chairforce Theme Best Practices

## Theme-Specific Development Patterns

### **Use Theme's Debug Functions**
```php
chairforce_write_log('Debug message');
chairforce_dump($variable);
// Don't use: error_log(), var_dump()
```

### **Follow Theme's Hook Registration Pattern**
```php
class CustomFeature {
    public function __construct() {
        $this->register_hooks();
    }
    
    private function register_hooks() {
        add_action('init', [$this, 'custom_function']);
        add_filter('the_content', [$this, 'custom_filter']);
    }
}
// Don't register hooks outside classes
```

### **Use Theme's Namespace and Constants**
```php
namespace Chairforce;
CHAIRFORCE_PREFIX . 'custom_hook'
CHAIRFORCE_VERSION
// Don't use generic namespaces
```

### **Follow Theme's File Organization**
```php
/lib/class-custom-feature.php           # PHP classes
/includes/custom-hooks.php              # Hook files
/src-acf-blocks/custom-block/           # ACF blocks
/src-jsx-blocks/custom-block/           # JSX blocks
// Don't create random directories
```

### **Use Theme's Asset Management**
```php
chairforce_get_build_url('css/main.css')
chairforce_get_build_dir('js/app.js')
// Don't hardcode asset paths
```

### **Follow Theme's ACF Pattern**
```php
chairforce_get_acf_block_classname($block, 'default-class')
// Don't manually build ACF classes
```

### **Use Theme's Blokki Integration**
```php
function chairforce_blokki_post_type_custom($post_type_config) {
    return array_merge($post_type_config, [
        'image_size' => 'medium_large',
        'partials' => ['image', 'title', 'excerpt']
    ]);
}
add_filter('blokki_get_post_type_config_custom', 'chairforce_blokki_post_type_custom');
```

### **Follow Theme's Sass Architecture**
```scss
$color-primary
$spacing-large
@include breakpoint(medium) { padding: 1.5rem; }
// Don't use direct CSS custom properties or custom breakpoints
```

### **Follow Theme's Block Pattern**
```php
register_block_type('chairforce/custom-block', [
    'render_callback' => 'chairforce_render_custom_block',
    'attributes' => $attributes
]);
// Don't use generic block registration
```

### **Use Theme's Nonce System**
```php
wp_create_nonce(CHAIRFORCE_PREFIX . 'custom_action')
wp_verify_nonce($_POST['_wpnonce'], CHAIRFORCE_PREFIX . 'custom_action')
// Don't use generic nonce names
```

